# Prettier reformats what it is given, and two kinds of file in this repo must
# keep the bytes their generator chose.
#
# `packages/sdk/src/generated` is deliberately absent: codegen runs Prettier
# over its own output with this repo's config, so the formatter and the
# generator already agree and the pre-commit hook is a no-op there.
#
# The reference spike's extracted stories are the opposite case. Each one is
# the verbatim text of a fenced block in `content/situations.mdx` — that
# byte-identity is the point, because the page shows the fence and the compiler
# reads the module, and they have to be the same code. Reformatting the module
# breaks `npm run stories:check`, which is what noticed.
packages/reference-spike/src/example/generated/
# Astro-generated content and route types.
packages/reference-spike/starlight/.astro/
